{"pr": 29039, "type": "features", "branch": "8.0.x", "title": "Product list preview in product list V2", "url": "https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/pull/29039", "issue": 30212, "issue_title": "Product page v2 list not showing product if its not in category \"Home\"", "issue_body": "### Prerequisites\n\n- [X] I understand and accept the project's [code of conduct](https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/blob/develop/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [X] I have already [searched in existing issues](https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/issues?q=is%3Aissue+label%3ABug) and found no previous report of this bug.\n\n### Describe the bug and add screenshots\n\nProduct page v2 list not showing product if its not in category \"Home\".\r\nIt seems to be due to the QueryBuilder which defaults to filter by category id of PS_HOME_CATEGORY in PrestaShop\\PrestaShop\\Core\\Grid\\Query\\ProductQueryBuilder::getFilteredCategoryId\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nAs in product page v1 it should show all the products that exists in database.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Make sure experimental product page v2 is on (Advanced Parameters -> New &Experimental features -> New product page - Single store switched on).\r\n2. Go to BO products list and open any product for edition and scroll down to categories part\r\n3. Remove \"Home\" category (you may first need to change the default category, because you cannot remove current default product category). This step could probably also be done in product page v1 by unselecting home category.\r\n4. Go to products list and see that the product is gone from list. (you could still find it by filtering by other category though)\n\n### PrestaShop version(s) where the bug happened\n\ndevelop\n\n### PHP version(s) where the bug happened\n\n_No response_\n\n### If your bug is related to a module, specify its name and its version\n\n_No response_", "base_commit": "edce9c0afa4b37cdbce108184f3b1d27376209cc", "merge_commit": "b1e58e5eb7c4c8bc0afe73aa237a3594c747297a", "files": ["admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/components/grid/extension/column/common/async-toggle-column-extension.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/components/navbar-handler.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/components/categories/category-tree-filter.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/edit/index.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/index.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/product-map.ts", "src/Adapter/Product/Grid/Data/Factory/ProductGridDataFactoryDecorator.php", "src/Core/Grid/Action/Row/Type/LinkRowAction.php", "src/Core/Grid/Column/Type/Common/ImageColumn.php", "src/Core/Grid/Definition/Factory/ProductGridDefinitionFactory.php", "src/Core/Grid/Filter/GridFilterFormFactory.php", "src/Core/Grid/Query/ProductQueryBuilder.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Controller/Admin/Sell/Catalog/Product/ProductController.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Entity/Repository/AdminFilterRepository.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Form/Admin/Type/IntegerMinMaxFilterType.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Form/Admin/Type/NumberMinMaxFilterType.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Form/Admin/Type/SearchAndResetType.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Resources/config/routing/admin/sell/catalog/product_v2/product.yml", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Resources/config/services/bundle/grid.yml", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Resources/views/Admin/Common/Grid/Actions/Row/link.html.twig", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Resources/views/Admin/Common/Grid/Blocks/EmptyState/product.html.twig", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Resources/views/Admin/Common/Grid/Columns/Content/image.html.twig", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Resources/views/Admin/Sell/Catalog/Product/FormTheme/categories.html.twig", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Resources/views/Admin/Sell/Catalog/Product/Grid/grid.html.twig", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Service/Grid/ResponseBuilder.php", "tests/Unit/PrestaShopBundle/Service/Grid/ResponseBuilderTest.php"], "lines": 648, "labels": ["QA ✔️", "Waiting for wording", "8.0.x", "Feature", "migration"]}
{"pr": 28752, "type": "features", "branch": "8.0.x", "title": "Improve extendability of the new product page form", "url": "https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/pull/28752", "issue": 28994, "issue_title": "Extend the product page", "issue_body": "### Prerequisites\n\n- [X] I understand and accept the project's [code of conduct](https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/blob/develop/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [X] I have already [searched in existing features request](https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/issues?q=is%3Aissue+label%3AImprovement%2CFeature%2CDeveloper+Feature+) and found no previous suggestion of this feature.\n\n### Is your feature request related to a problem?\n\nAs a module developer, I want to be able to extend the product page. \n\n### Describe the solution you'd like\n\nAdd new tab and field in the product form for my module\n\n### Alternatives you've considered\n\n_No response_\n\n### Additional context\n\n_No response_\n\n### Do you plan to work on this feature?\n\n- [X] I'm willing to contribute a [formal specification](https://github.com/PrestaShop/prestashop-specs).\n- [X] I'm willing to provide any wireframes or design assets required for this feature.\n- [ ] I'm willing to submit a Pull Request that implements this feature.\n- [ ] I'm willing to help verify that the implemented feature works as intended and produces no unintended side effects.", "base_commit": "18e2fb40b6a89f5e75eabe8d05db250b00e5f95a", "merge_commit": "435dc7952845854c02e75d5d6b1bed96825ab238", "files": ["admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/product-map.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/scss/components/_navigation_tab.scss", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/scss/pages/product/product_page.scss", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/scss/theme.scss", "src/Adapter/Hook/HookInformationProvider.php", "src/Adapter/Shop/Url/HelpProvider.php", "src/Core/Grid/Column/Type/Common/LinkColumn.php", "src/Core/Grid/Definition/Factory/ProductGridDefinitionFactory.php", "src/Core/Grid/Definitio