{"pr": 28598, "type": "features", "branch": "8.0.x", "title": "Improve FormFieldDisabler into FormFieldToggler and use it for \"show prices\" and \"delivery times\" in product page", "url": "https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/pull/28598", "issue": 28993, "issue_title": "Show price - Product page", "issue_body": "### Prerequisites\n\n- [X] I understand and accept the project's [code of conduct](https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/blob/develop/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [X] I have already [searched in existing features request](https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/issues?q=is%3Aissue+label%3AImprovement%2CFeature%2CDeveloper+Feature+) and found no previous suggestion of this feature.\n\n### Is your feature request related to a problem?\n\nAs a merchant, I want to be able to hide the price of my product when I want to.\n\n### Describe the solution you'd like\n\nAvailable for order - Switch button - by default, the switch is ON.\r\nIF the user switches to OFF, THEN the add to cart button is disabled on the product page in the front office and the “Show price” switch input is enabled and set to ON.\r\nIF the user switches to ON, THEN “Show price” switch input is disabled and set to ON.\r\n\r\nShow price - Switch button\r\nIF the user switches to OFF, THEN the product price isn’t displayed on the product page and product lists in the front office. For a pack, the price of the pack and the prices of the products contained in the pack are not displayed.\n\n### Alternatives you've considered\n\n_No response_\n\n### Additional context\n\n_No response_\n\n### Do you plan to work on this feature?\n\n- [X] I'm willing to contribute a [formal specification](https://github.com/PrestaShop/prestashop-specs).\n- [X] I'm willing to provide any wireframes or design assets required for this feature.\n- [ ] I'm willing to submit a Pull Request that implements this feature.\n- [ ] I'm willing to help verify that the implemented feature works as intended and produces no unintended side effects.", "base_commit": "0913c9dca0e82a5f1d5220f826fb50dbbd4ec895", "merge_commit": "259150a78676dcaf93c76955ae24956b71d6013d", "files": ["admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/app/utils/init-components.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/components/form/disabling-switch.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/components/form/form-field-toggler.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/combination/bulk.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/combination/quantity-mode-switcher.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/edit/index.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/edit/product-options-manager.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/edit/product-shipping-manager.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/edit/specific-prices-manager.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/product-map.ts", "src/Adapter/Product/CommandHandler/UpdateProductOptionsHandler.php", "src/Core/Form/ChoiceProvider/DeliveryTimeNoteTypesProvider.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Form/Admin/Sell/Product/Options/VisibilityType.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Form/Admin/Sell/Product/Shipping/DeliveryTimeNotesType.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Resources/config/services/core/form/choice_provider.yml", "tests/Integration/Behaviour/Features/Scenario/Product/update_options.feature"], "lines": 396, "labels": ["QA ✔️", "develop", "Feature", "Refactoring", "migration", "BC break", "Documentation ✔️"]}
{"pr": 28482, "type": "features", "branch": "8.0.x", "title": "Handle product ecotax in product v2 (for both standard and combination form)", "url": "https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/pull/28482", "issue": 25907, "issue_title": "BO - Product V2 - The Impact price is not refreshed (Ajax issue)", "issue_body": "<!--\r\n****************************\r\nDO NOT disclose security issues here, contact security@prestashop.com instead!\r\n****************************\r\n-->\r\n\r\n#### Describe the bug\r\n\r\nIn the BO > Catalog > Product page V2 > Combination details page,\r\nThe Impact on the price is not updated automatically. => it is an ajax issue.\r\n\r\n#### Steps to Reproduce\r\n\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n\r\n1. Go to BO > Advanced Parameters > Experimental Features page\r\n2. Enable Experimental product page\r\n3. Go to BO > Catalog > Products page and edit a product with combinations V2\r\n4. Edit a combination\r\n5. Set the impact on price tax excluded and click outside\r\n6. The impact on price tax included is not changed\r\n7. Refresh the page => it will be ok\r\n8. Set the impact on price tax included and click outside\r\n9. The impact on price tax excluded is not changed\r\n10. Refresh the page => it will be NOK => the impact on price tax included is **converted**\r\n\r\n\r\n**Screenshots**\r\nhttps://www.awesomescreenshot.com/video/5253538?key=cb77df6550b6a4e059f9b6bf1433d30d\r\n\r\n#### Additional information\r\n\r\n* PrestaShop version: 1.7.8.0rc1build4\r\n* PHP version: 7.2\r\n", "base_commit": "116dc4f27c484ff108ccea9a5da0343d64bf273e", "merge_commit": "828c5701955bd33ab28188b5fa61a8bc33d05dfe", "files": ["admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/components/form/form-object-mapper.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/combination/form/combination-event-map.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/combination/form/combination-form-mapping.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/combination/form/combination-form-model.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/components/combination-list/combinations-list-renderer.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/components/combination-modal/CombinationModal.vue", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/edit/price-summary.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/edit/product-form-mapping.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/edit/product-form-model.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/edit/product-type-switcher.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/product-event-map.ts", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/scss/pages/product/product_page.scss", "classes/Product.php", "src/Adapter/Form/ChoiceProvider/TaxRuleGroupChoiceProvider.php", "src/Adapter/Product/Combination/QueryHandler/GetCombinationForEditingHandler.php", "src/Adapter/Product/CommandHandler/UpdateProductPricesHandler.php", "src/Adapter/Product/Grid/Data/Factory/ProductGridDataFactoryDecorator.php", "src/Adapter/Product/QueryHandler/GetProductForEditingHandler.php", "src/Adapter/Product/Update/ProductPricePropertiesFiller.php", "src/Adapter/Product/Update/ProductTypeUpdater.php", "src/Adapter/Tax/TaxComputer.php", "src/Core/Domain/Product/Combination/QueryResult/CombinationPrices.php", "src/Core/Domain/Product/QueryResult/ProductPricesInformation.php", "src/Core/Form/IdentifiableObject/CommandBuilder/Product/Combination/CombinationPriceCommandsBuilder.php", "src/Core/Form/IdentifiableObject/CommandBuilder/Product/PricesCommandsBuilder.php", "src/Core/Form/IdentifiableObject/DataProvider/CombinationFormDataProvider.php", "src/Core/Form/IdentifiableObject/DataProvider/ProductFormDataProvider.php", "src/Core/Grid/Definition/Factory/ProductGridDefinitionFactory.php", "src/Core/Grid/Presenter/GridPresenter.php", "src/Core/Grid/Query/ProductQueryBuilder.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Form/Admin/Sell/Product/Combination/CombinationItemType.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Form/Admin/Sell/Product/Combination/CombinationPriceImpactType.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Form/Admin/Sell/Product/EventListener/ProductTypeListener.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Form/Admin/Sell/Product/HeaderType.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Form/Admin/Sell/Product/Pricing/RetailPriceType.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Resources/config/services/adapter/product.yml", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Resources/config/services/adapter/product/_combination.yml", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Resources/config/services/bundle/form/form_type.yml", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Resources/views/Admin/Sell/Catalog/Product/Blocks/header-details.html.twig", "tests/Integration/Behaviour/Features/Context/Configuration/AbstractConfigurationFeatureContext.php", "tests/Integration/Behaviour/Features/Context/Configuration/CommonConfigurationFeatureContext.php", "tests/Integration/Behaviour/Features/Context/Configuration/PackConfigurationFeatureContext.php", "tests/Integration/Behaviour/Features/Context/Configuration/RoundingModeConfigurationFeatureContext.php", "tests/Integration/Behaviour/Features/Context/Configuration/RoundingTypeConfigurationFeatureContext.php", "tests/Integration/Behaviour/Features/Context/Domain/Product/Combination/UpdateCombinationPricesFeatureContext.php", "tests/Integration/Behaviour/Features/Context/Domain/Product/UpdatePricesFeatureContext.php", "tests/Integration/Behaviour/Features/Context/Domain/TaxRulesGroupFeatureContext.php", "tests/Integration/Behaviour/Features/Scenario/Product/Combination/update_combination_prices.feature", "tests/Integration/Behaviour/Features/Scenario/Product/Combination/update_combination_suppliers.feature", "tests/Integration/Behaviour/Features/Scenario/Product/Shop/update_multishop_prices.feature", "tests/Integration/Behaviour/Features/Scenario/Product/update_prices.feature", "tests/Integration/Behaviour/Features/Scenario/Product/update_prices_ecotax.feature", "tests/Integration/Behaviour/Features/Scenario/Product/update_product_type.feature", "tests/Integration/PrestaShopBundle/Controller/Sell/Catalog/ProductControllerTest